      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCKY FIREBALL (3) turned in a moderate performance last time when seventh at this track over 380m behind Lord Eddie (22.36) in a Free For All. Can make amends. MISS PUMPKIN (8) missed the frame last time when fifth (22.14) at this track but prior to that had three placings in a row. Has a good record at this journey. Has ability and is one of the better chances. ETERNAL WINTER (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.08 beating Ellen Rose. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Can make it two on the bounce. KAREN STRATUS (1) is fresh from a short break and ready to run well.",
